## Workflow Complexity

| Level  | Scope                     | Default Path                      |
| ------ | ------------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| **L1** | <10 lines, single file    | Execute directly                  |
| **L2** | <100 lines, 1-3 files     | Brief analysis → implement        |
